## Before going live – Notebook checks

```
fetch dt.synthetic.events
| filter dt.synthetic.monitor.id == "HTTP_CHECK-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX"
| fields timestamp, event.type, dt.entity.synthetic_location, dt.synthetic.step.sequence_number,
         result.state, result.status.code, result.status.message, result.statistics.url
| sort timestamp desc
| limit 20
```

Confirm:
1. `event.type` values are `http_monitor_execution` / `http_step_execution`.
2. `dt.entity.synthetic_location` is filled on monitor executions (deprecated in favour of `dt.smartscape.synthetic_location`, still usable).
3. Whether `dt.synthetic.step.sequence_number` starts at 0 (then set `STEP_OFFSET = 1`).
4. `result.statistics.url` is populated.
5. The problem link in a test email opens the problem (`/ui/apps/dynatrace.davis.problems/problem/P-…`).
